/*
 * A bear attacks you. The encounter is more dangerous if caught in the middle of fishing.
 */


:: Fishing Forest Lake Bear Attack
<<effects>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 bear>>
You hear a crash from the treeline behind you, and before you can turn around a massive <<beasttype>> is upon you, pinning you down with <<bhis>> weight.
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Forest Lake Bear Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Bear Interrupt Attack
<<effects>>
<<run endFishingCombat()>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 bear>>
<<set $fishingBearMouthTarget to random(1, 4)>>
You're focused on your catch when a crash erupts from the treeline. A massive <<beasttype>> is upon you,
<<if $fishingBearMouthTarget is 1>>
	<span class="red"><<bhis>> mouth closing around your neck</span> before you can react.
<<elseif $fishingBearMouthTarget is 2>>
	<span class="red">snapping <<bhis>> jaws at your head</span> before you can react.
<<else>>
	knocking you to the ground before you can react.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Forest Lake Bear Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Bear Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 40>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 40>>
	<<set $enemyhealthmax to 400>>
	<<set $enemyhealth to 400>>
	<<set $enemyarousalmax to 1000>>
	
	<<if $fishingBearMouthTarget is 1>>
		<<set $NPCList[0].mouth to "neck">>
		<<set $head to "grappled">>
	<<elseif $fishingBearMouthTarget is 2>>
		<<set $NPCList[0].mouth to "hair">>
		<<set $head to "grappled">>
	<</if>>
	<<unset $fishingBearMouthTarget>>
	<<forestRescueSetup>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<<forestRescueCheck "bear">>
<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Bear Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Bear Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Bear Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<set $fishing.lake.event to "none">>
<<set $fishing.lake.eventDanger to 0>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>

	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> returns to the forest.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather your things and step back from the shore.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You scare the mighty <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> flees from the lakeshore, crashing through the treeline.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather your things and step back from the shore.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $rescue is 1 and $alarm is 1>>
	<<forestRescue>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Forest Lake Bear [widget]
/* Text that can appear while waiting if a bear will attack soon */
<<widget "fishingForestLakeBearAttackWaitAmbient">>
	<<addinlineevent 20>>
		<<print either(
			"You see movement in the trees to your side. Probably just a deer.",
			"The musty smell of wet fur drifts on the breeze.",
			"You hear heavy footfalls somewhere in the forest.",
			"Branches snap in the forest behind you.",
			"You feel like something is watching you."
		)>>
		<<set $fishing.lake.eventDanger += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
